      "type": "DSA_TRACE_STACK",
      "narration": "Return len of stack equals zero. An empty pile means every opener that went on came back off, which is precisely what balanced means. And if the pile still had something on it, that'd be an opener nobody ever closed, so the answer would be False. True. One pass through the string, and every character was looked at exactly once.",
